imacron{$E\theta$}\textasciimacron\textbackslash overline\textbraceleft\textbackslash unicode[STIX]\textbraceleft x1D700\textbraceright\_\textbraceleft\textbackslash unicode[STIX]\textbraceleft x1D703\textbraceright\textbraceright\textbraceright{} , established for   h+h+h\textasciicircum\textbraceleft +\textbraceright{}  (  ⩾400⩾400\textbraceleft\textbackslash geqslant\textbraceright 400 ). The resulting heat transfer law also holds at a smaller   h+h+h\textasciicircum\textbraceleft +\textbraceright{}  (  ⩾200⩾200\textbraceleft\textbackslash geqslant\textbraceright 200 ) than that derived by assuming a log law for the mean temperature.},
